    "id": "7769044",
    "date": "2026-09-01",
    "title": "Let the first sign-in on an empty install reach a workspace",
    "detail": "The bootstrap let somebody through the door of an install with no operator configured and nobody in the access table, and then resolveOwner refused them a workspace, which is a locked door with the key inside.\n\nBoth now allow the same two cases: an operator, or the first person into an install that has nobody yet.",
