    "detail": "Every example in the interface named Eterneon's own work: Vandrix, Ravenmoor, Frontier Assembly, Steam pages, Minecraft modding. Correct here, wrong in anyone else's install, where the panel would be showing a stranger's projects back at them as suggestions.\n\nFourteen of them now describe what the field is for, which is what the Company Profile page already did and what the rest should have copied. \"What needs doing\" rather than \"Write the Steam short description\".\n\nNothing outside the seeded skills names the studio now.",
