    "detail": "Skills could already be disabled. What was missing was any way to see which ones were worth disabling: every enabled skill is injected in full on every message to that department, and a company-wide one is paid for across all of them.\n\nEach row now says roughly what it costs a message, and a disabled one says what it is saving. The estimate moved out of the Information page into lib/skills, since the page that shows the number and the page where the decision is made are not the same page.",
