    "date": "2026-08-31",
    "title": "Say which server has no key",
    "detail": "The same message answered for the development server and the deployment, which reads as a bug when you know you set the key: it is on Vercel, and Vercel's environment does not reach localhost. Each now names the server it came from and the fix that applies there.",
